-- title:
--   Original BV source-exact indexed compact C1 signed Lévy jump-time series on one stopped path event
-- statement:
--   For every natural-number compact interior C1 localisation band of the actual original bounded-variation Lévy process and original admissible dividend strategy, on a fixed original ruin/horizon clock, one original full-probability path event carries the exact identity between the compensated-source real nonlinear marked jump integral and the positive-minus-negative original Lévy jump-time series. The original left-reserve, zero exclusion and final contact remain unchanged; no additional L,R or unexplained integrability hypothesis is required. This is the direct countable index match needed to combine the accepted compensated HJB indexed stochastic source with the original physical grid.

